flowchart TD
    subgraph Client [Client Clients]
        Web[WebMail / Mobile App]
    end

    subgraph Federation [External Networks]
        ExtMTA[External Mail Servers<br/>Yahoo, Microsoft]
    end

    subgraph Edge [Edge & API]
        LB[Load Balancer]
        API[API Gateway]
        Notif[Notification Service<br/>WebSockets]
    end

    subgraph Inbound [Inbound Pipeline]
        SMTPIn[Inbound SMTP Workers]
        Kafka[Kafka Event Queue]
        SpamAV[Spam / AV Checkers]
        MDA[Mail Delivery Agent<br/>MDA]
    end

    subgraph Outbound [Outbound Pipeline]
        SMTPOut[Outbound SMTP Workers]
    end

    subgraph Storage [Data & Storage]
        Cassandra[(Metadata DB<br/>Cassandra)]
        S3[(Object Store<br/>S3)]
        Search[(Search Index<br/>RocksDB/Lucene per User)]
    end

    %% Client flows
    Web -->|HTTP REST| LB
    LB --> API
    Web <-->|WebSockets| Notif

    %% Internal API flows
    API -->|Read| Cassandra
    API -->|Search| Search
    API -->|Send Msg| Kafka

    %% Inbound flow
    ExtMTA -->|SMTP In| SMTPIn
    SMTPIn -->|1. Store Raw| S3
    SMTPIn -->|2. Enqueue| Kafka
    Kafka -->|Poll| SpamAV
    SpamAV --> MDA
    MDA -->|Write Meta| Cassandra
    MDA -->|Index text| Search
    MDA -->|Notify| Notif

    %% Outbound flow
    Kafka -->|Send External| SMTPOut
    SMTPOut -->|SMTP Out| ExtMTA
